  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A bimetallic strip consists of metals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. It is mounted rigidly as shown. The metal <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> has higher coefficient of expansion compared to that of metal&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. When the bimetallic strip is placed in a cold both, it will :</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ecce5b85-b144-42b5-98ea-dd478f391dd1-image.png\" style=\"width: 166px; height: 127px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "JrEG3",
      "text": "Bend towards the right",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yogNi",
      "text": "Not bend but shrink",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GEIxE",
      "text": "Neither bend nor shrink",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qQJBK",
      "text": "Bend towards the left",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p><p>Length of both strips will decrease <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/66a64360-93df-4647-958b-6b8b325e7ce4-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 133px;\" /></p>",
